      "text": "Lehi1 exhorts Laman1 to be like river, continually running into fountain of righteousness, 1 Ne. 2:9. strait and narrow path leads by head of fountain, 1 Ne. 8:20. iron rod leads to fountain of living waters, 1 Ne. 11:25. fountain of filthy waters is depths of hell, 1 Ne. 12:16. Alma1 hides by fountain of pure water in Mormon, Mosiah 18:5. Moroni2 writes so that men may come to fountain of all righteousness, Ether 8:26. the Lord is fountain of all righteousness, Ether 12:28. bitter fountain cannot bring forth good water, nor good fountain bitter water, Moro. 7:11.",
